["<aside class=\"callout why\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>The same patch of bush can be empty at noon and full at 4 pm. Time and weather move grouse as much as habitat does.</p></aside><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 430\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A 24 hour clock of a grouse day, hunter lore, 75 percent. About 6 to 9 am: feed and pick grit on edges and roads. About 9 am to 3 pm: rest and dust bathe. About 3 pm to dusk: feed again. Night: roost in trees or snow. Legal hunting hours: 1 hour before sunrise to 1 hour after sunset. Tip: at midday spruce and dusky grouse often sit in trees, which is your .22 time.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"430\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A grouse day (hunter lore, 75%)</text>\n<circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"168\" r=\"110\" fill=\"#f4eedf\"/>\n<path d=\"M96.0 168.0 A104 104 0 0 1 304.0 168.0 L248.0 168.0 A48 48 0 0 0 152.0 168.0z\" fill=\"#3d4f6b\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n<path d=\"M304.0 168.0 A104 104 0 0 1 273.5 241.5 L233.9 201.9 A48 48 0 0 0 248.0 168.0z\" fill=\"#e9c46a\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n<path d=\"M273.5 241.5 A104 104 0 0 1 126.5 241.5 L166.1 201.9 A48 48 0 0 0 233.9 201.9z\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n<path d=\"M126.5 241.5 A104 104 0 0 1 96.0 168.0 L152.0 168.0 A48 48 0 0 0 166.1 201.9z\" fill=\"#e9c46a\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"97\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Roost</text>\n<text x=\"270.2\" y=\"202.1\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Feed</text>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"249\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Rest, dust</text>\n<text x=\"129.8\" y=\"202.1\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Feed</text>\n<circle cx=\"153.7\" cy=\"107.7\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#f3e7b3\"/><circle cx=\"157.3\" cy=\"105.7\" r=\"6.8\" fill=\"#3d4f6b\"/>\n<circle cx=\"246.3\" cy=\"107.7\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#e9e4cf\"/><circle cx=\"232.3\" cy=\"115.7\" r=\"1.3\" fill=\"#e9e4cf\"/>\n<circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"168\" r=\"46\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"174\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">24 hours</text>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Midnight</text>\n<text x=\"320\" y=\"173\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">6 am</text>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Noon</text>\n<text x=\"80\" y=\"173\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"end\">6 pm</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"316\" width=\"384\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f4eedf\"/>\n<circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"336\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#8f8d86\"/><circle cx=\"27\" cy=\"330\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#8f8d86\"/><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"337\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#8f8d86\"/><circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"339\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#8f8d86\"/>\n<text x=\"46\" y=\"338\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Morning feed includes grit on road edges.</text>\n<circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"369\" r=\"10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><path d=\"M26 363 V369 L30 372\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"/>\n<text x=\"46\" y=\"374\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Legal: 1 h before sunrise to 1 h after sunset.</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"388\" width=\"384\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f4eedf\"/>\n<rect x=\"24.5\" y=\"413.0\" width=\"3\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#5a3d22\"/><path d=\"M26.0 393.0 L31.5 403.8 L29.0 403.8 L36.1 414.0 L15.9 414.0 L23.0 403.8 L20.5 403.8z\" fill=\"#3a5a31\"/>\n<text x=\"46\" y=\"410\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Midday: spruce, dusky often sit in trees (Tip).</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Feed early and late, rest midday, roost at night (hunter lore, 75%).</li><li>Legal: 1 hour before sunrise to 1 hour after sunset <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the day, with the evidence level for each claim</summary><div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Claim</th><th>Evidence</th><th>Certainty</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Feed early morning and late afternoon</td><td>Agency and hunter accounts</td><td>75%</td></tr><tr><td>Pick grit and dust on road edges</td><td>Agency accounts, sign</td><td>75%</td></tr><tr><td>Rest and dust bathe midday</td><td>Hunter accounts</td><td>70%</td></tr><tr><td>Spruce and dusky sit in trees midday</td><td>Hunter accounts</td><td>65%</td></tr><tr><td>Roost in trees, ground or snow at night</td><td>Agency accounts</td><td>75%</td></tr><tr><td>Adults move only a few hundred metres a day</td><td>Pennsylvania Game Commission</td><td>75%</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li>Hours rule: \"To hunt game, except migratory game birds from one hour after sunset to one hour before sunrise\" is unlawful (99%, item 38, <a href=\"#/s/rb-legal-methods/13\">Rule Book</a>).</li></ul></details><aside class=\"callout warn\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Warning</div><p>Study aid only. The official regulations are the law.</p></aside>","<div class=\"gallery\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/hab-grass-fir-edge.jpg\" alt=\"Grass and fir edge: morning feeding ground.\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Grass and fir edge: morning feeding ground. <span class=\"credit\">Photo: Andres Alvarado, CC BY-SA 2.0, <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Great_colorful_of_Lac_Du_Bois_Grasslands.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">source</a></span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/hab-snowberry.jpg\" alt=\"Snowberry: a fall and winter food.\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Snowberry: a fall and winter food. <span class=\"credit\">Photo: NPS Photo, Public domain, <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:File-Symphoricarpos_albus_-_native;-Blooms_June_-_July;_(9352ce2f-155d-4519-3e7c-5033029f6900).jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">source</a></span></figcaption></figure></div><ul><li>First light to mid morning: edges, trails, road shoulders <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>They need grit for the gizzard <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: morning detail</summary><ul><li>Grouse pick small gravel to grind food in the gizzard <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>. Road edges and trails supply it <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Young birds in September and October feed on clover and berries along road edges and cut blocks (65 to 75%).</li><li>Sharp tailed grouse use roadsides and landings with clover, dandelion and yarrow heavily in fall (85%, BC species account).</li><li>Roads are also where the rules bite. See <a href=\"#/s/mc-grouse-09/6\">How to hunt</a> before you hunt a road edge.</li><li>Tip: walk an old closed road or a trail away from traffic at first light.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 330\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A spruce tree with a dark spruce grouse sitting on a branch close to the trunk, circled in orange. It looks like a dark blob near the trunk with the tail hanging down. Tip: look up slowly; midday is the time.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"330\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Spot a grouse sitting in a tree</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"38\" width=\"384\" height=\"232\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eef0\"/>\n<path d=\"M8 250 C80 240 160 246 240 244 C300 242 350 246 392 240 V270 H8z\" fill=\"#cfd8b8\"/>\n<rect x=\"135\" y=\"60\" width=\"10\" height=\"196\" fill=\"#5c4030\"/>\n<path d=\"M140 52 Q151.0 59.7 162.0 76.0 L162.0 72.3 L157.1 80.6 L152.2 75.8 L147.3 81.5 L142.4 73.4 L137.6 76.4 L132.7 71.9 L127.8 78.4 L122.9 71.6 L118.0 77.4 Q129.0 59.7 140 52z\" fill=\"#2e4a2c\"/>\n<path d=\"M140 56 Q149.0 61.4 158.0 73.4 L158.0 69.6 L154.0 78.2 L150.0 73.2 L146.0 78.4 L142.0 74.0 L138.0 74.7 L134.0 69.0 L130.0 74.4 L126.0 70.1 L122.0 76.6 Q131.0 61.4 140 56z\" fill=\"#3d5f37\"/>\n<path d=\"M140 66 Q158.0 74.4 176.0 92.0 L176.0 88.1 L168.0 95.0 L160.0 91.0 L152.0 95.6 L144.0 87.5 L136.0 97.3 L128.0 92.1 L120.0 96.4 L112.0 90.8 L104.0 93.9 Q122.0 74.4 140 66z\" fill=\"#2e4a2c\"/>\n<path d=\"M140 70 Q154.8 75.9 169.5 88.8 L169.5 88.9 L163.0 94.1 L156.4 87.2 L149.8 94.3 L143.3 85.6 L136.7 92.1 L130.2 89.0 L123.6 94.4 L117.0 84.3 L110.5 91.6 Q125.2 75.9 140 70z\" fill=\"#3d5f37\"/>\n<path d=\"M140 84 Q165.0 93.1 190.0 112.0 L190.0 110.8 L178.9 112.3 L167.8 107.3 L156.7 116.9 L145.6 108.8 L134.4 113.0 L123.3 109.6 L112.2 115.6 L101.1 109.5 L90.0 115.1 Q115.0 93.1 140 84z\" fill=\"#2e4a2c\"/>\n<path d=\"M140 88 Q160.5 94.4 181.0 108.2 L181.0 104.9 L171.9 112.0 L162.8 104.4 L153.7 110.7 L144.6 104.4 L135.4 114.2 L126.3 105.3 L117.2 111.0 L108.1 106.4 L99.0 109.9 Q119.5 94.4 140 88z\" fill=\"#3d5f37\"/>\n<path d=\"M140 104 Q171.0 113.8 202.0 134.0 L202.0 132.7 L188.2 138.6 L174.4 130.4 L160.7 134.4 L146.9 129.6 L133.1 139.4 L119.3 132.4 L105.6 135.9 L91.8 133.5 L78.0 136.1 Q109.0 113.8 140 104z\" fill=\"#2e4a2c\"/>\n<path d=\"M140 108 Q165.4 114.9 190.8 129.6 L190.8 130.4 L179.5 134.0 L168.2 130.3 L156.9 135.0 L145.6 128.8 L134.4 129.9 L123.1 127.4 L111.8 130.7 L100.5 126.6 L89.2 131.0 Q114.6 114.9 140 108z\" fill=\"#3d5f37\"/>\n<path d=\"M140 126 Q177.0 136.5 214.0 158.0 L214.0 154.1 L197.6 159.8 L181.1 157.9 L164.7 161.7 L148.2 158.7 L131.8 160.5 L115.3 157.7 L98.9 163.8 L82.4 154.7 L66.0 158.1 Q103.0 136.5 140 126z\" fill=\"#2e4a2c\"/>\n<path d=\"M140 130 Q170.3 137.3 200.7 153.0 L200.7 150.2 L187.2 157.7 L173.7 149.0 L160.2 153.3 L146.7 148.1 L133.3 155.0 L119.8 153.8 L106.3 155.3 L92.8 148.8 L79.3 155.7 Q109.7 137.3 140 130z\" fill=\"#3d5f37\"/>\n<path d=\"M140 150 Q184.0 161.2 228.0 184.0 L228.0 179.9 L208.4 188.1 L188.9 180.0 L169.3 184.3 L149.8 179.4 L130.2 185.2 L110.7 181.5 L91.1 189.9 L71.6 179.6 L52.0 185.7 Q96.0 161.2 140 150z\" fill=\"#2e4a2c\"/>\n<path d=\"M140 154 Q176.1 161.8 212.2 178.4 L212.2 176.3 L196.1 184.3 L180.1 175.9 L164.1 183.0 L148.0 176.6 L132.0 179.1 L115.9 179.4 L99.9 179.9 L83.9 176.3 L67.8 178.6 Q103.9 161.8 140 154z\" fill=\"#3d5f37\"/>\n<path d=\"M140 176 Q190.0 187.9 240.0 212.0 L240.0 208.5 L217.8 212.2 L195.6 210.0 L173.3 217.0 L151.1 212.3 L128.9 213.5 L106.7 209.5 L84.4 212.2 L62.2 209.5 L40.0 213.5 Q90.0 187.9 140 176z\" fill=\"#2e4a2c\"/>\n<path d=\"M140 180 Q181.0 188.3 222.0 205.8 L222.0 203.2 L203.8 211.7 L185.6 204.2 L167.3 211.4 L149.1 201.1 L130.9 206.7 L112.7 206.0 L94.4 207.2 L76.2 202.0 L58.0 207.3 Q99.0 188.3 140 180z\" fill=\"#3d5f37\"/>\n<path d=\"M140 204 Q196.0 215.9 252.0 240.0 L252.0 240.5 L227.1 245.4 L202.2 240.2 L177.3 241.3 L152.4 235.6 L127.6 243.0 L102.7 239.5 L77.8 244.7 L52.9 238.9 L28.0 245.4 Q84.0 215.9 140 204z\" fill=\"#2e4a2c\"/>\n<path d=\"M140 208 Q185.9 216.3 231.8 233.8 L231.8 234.3 L211.4 235.4 L191.0 232.9 L170.6 237.7 L150.2 232.0 L129.8 238.7 L109.4 232.7 L89.0 238.6 L68.6 232.7 L48.2 235.8 Q94.1 216.3 140 208z\" fill=\"#3d5f37\"/>\n<path d=\"M140 40 L134 58 L146 58z\" fill=\"#2e4a2c\"/>\n<path d=\"M174.1 156.0 L177.9 166.4 L171.4 173.5 L173.9 187.8 L162.9 186.3 L160.2 198.0 L152.2 194.9 L146.0 203.0 L139.7 195.2 L130.9 200.7 L130.3 184.1 L120.2 185.4 L121.6 172.8 L112.5 166.9 L118.6 156.0 L111.3 144.7 L122.9 140.1 L120.6 127.1 L128.5 124.7 L131.9 114.1 L139.8 117.2 L146.0 109.0 L152.2 117.5 L161.2 110.8 L163.4 124.9 L172.8 125.4 L171.1 138.7 L178.3 145.5z\" fill=\"#22381f\"/>\n<rect x=\"136\" y=\"110\" width=\"8\" height=\"88\" fill=\"#5c4030\"/>\n<path d=\"M144 159 L184 164\" stroke=\"#4a3426\" stroke-width=\"3.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(158 150)\"><path d=\"M-4 4 C-8 14 -9 26 -6 36 L2 36 C3 26 4 14 4 6z\" fill=\"#2a2a27\"/><path d=\"M-6 33 L2 33 L2 36 L-6 36z\" fill=\"#a0582a\"/><ellipse cx=\"2\" cy=\"-2\" rx=\"11\" ry=\"13\" fill=\"#3b3b37\"/><path d=\"M-3 -8 C0 -4 2 4 0 10\" stroke=\"#6b6b62\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" fill=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"-15\" r=\"6.4\" fill=\"#2a2a27\"/><path d=\"M3 -19 C5 -21 8 -21 10 -19\" stroke=\"#d1342a\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M12 -16 L16 -14.6 L12 -13.6z\" fill=\"#1b1d1a\"/><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"-15.5\" r=\"1.2\" fill=\"#e8e2d0\"/><path d=\"M-2 10 L-4 12 M4 10 L6 12\" stroke=\"#4a3426\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/></g>\n<circle cx=\"159\" cy=\"156\" r=\"32\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3.4\"/>\n<line x1=\"191\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"238\" y2=\"136\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"191\" cy=\"150\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><rect x=\"237.5\" y=\"118.0\" width=\"124.9\" height=\"49.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n<text x=\"300\" y=\"138.5\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A dark blob</text>\n<text x=\"300\" y=\"158.5\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">near the trunk</text>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"296\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Tail hangs down. Look up, slowly.</text>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"318\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#b8450a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Midday is the time (Tip).</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Birds loaf in cover and dust bathe <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>The best time to still hunt sitters with the .22 (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: midday detail</summary><ul><li>Dust bathing: shallow bowls in dry dirt on road edges and banks, used to clean feathers <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">80%</span>.</li><li>Spruce grouse spend fall and winter days up in conifers (80%, Washington Department of Fish and Wildlife, earlier lesson).</li><li>Dusky grouse sit in big Douglas fir (Tip).</li><li>Tip: slow down at midday; look up, not ahead.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram anim\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Animation of thermals on a slope. Morning: the sun rises and warms the slope, warm air rises, and scent drifts uphill, so approach from above or the side. Evening: the sun sets, the slope cools, cool air sinks, and scent drifts downhill, so hunt from below or the side and leave before cold air drains your scent down to bedded deer.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#dbe7f3\"/>\n  <circle r=\"18\" fill=\"#f3d36b\" cx=\"40\" cy=\"250\">\n    <animate attributeName=\"cy\" values=\"250;70;70;250\" keyTimes=\"0;0.3;0.6;1\" dur=\"9s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n    <animate attributeName=\"cx\" values=\"40;80;330;370\" keyTimes=\"0;0.3;0.6;1\" dur=\"9s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n    <animate attributeName=\"fill\" values=\"#f3d36b;#f3d36b;#f2a56b;#e8590c\" keyTimes=\"0;0.5;0.8;1\" dur=\"9s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n  </circle>\n  <path d=\"M0 290 L0 260 Q150 240 260 120 Q300 80 400 60 L400 290 Z\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/>\n  <g transform=\"translate(220 160)\"><ellipse rx=\"16\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><circle cx=\"-14\" cy=\"-7\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/></g>\n  <g stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0\">\n    <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.1;0.5;0.55;1\" dur=\"9s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n    <path d=\"M90 250 Q150 220 200 175 m-14 2 l14 -2 l-2 14\"/>\n    <path d=\"M150 260 Q220 210 270 140 m-14 2 l14 -2 l-2 14\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0\">\n    <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.6;0.65;1\" dur=\"9s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n    <path d=\"M270 120 Q220 190 160 235 m2 -14 l-2 14 l14 0\"/>\n    <path d=\"M330 100 Q280 170 230 215 m2 -14 l-2 14 l14 0\"/>\n  </g>\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"36\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Morning: warm air, scent goes UP\n    <set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"0\" begin=\"4.9s\" fill=\"freeze\"/></text>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#f3d36b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" opacity=\"0\">Evening: cool air, scent sinks DOWN\n    <set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"1\" begin=\"4.9s\" fill=\"freeze\"/></text>\n  <g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1;1;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.05;0.9;1\" begin=\"1.5s\" dur=\"3.3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"96\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">You: above</text></g>\n  <g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" from=\"0\" to=\"1\" begin=\"6s\" dur=\".4s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"262\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"105\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">You: below</text></g>\n</svg>\n<figcaption>Thermals: up in the morning, down in the evening. <button class=\"anim-replay\">↻ Replay</button></figcaption></figure><ul><li>Last 2 hours of light: birds feed again (hunter lore, 70%).</li><li>Legal light ends 1 hour after sunset <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: evening detail</summary><ul><li>Late afternoon feeding mirrors the morning: edges, berries, clover, buds <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>In bitter cold, some hunters see birds feed in the warmest hours, about 1 to 4 pm (hunter account, 50%: Tip).</li><li>Roost: in trees (often conifers), on the ground, or under soft snow <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Thermals sink in the evening, so a dog working uphill gets scent from above (Tip).</li><li>Shooting light fades fast in timber; your watch says legal, the woods may say no (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 506\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Weather: where to look for grouse, six tiles. Strong wind: birds are wild and flush far, hunt sheltered draws, hunter lore (Tip). Rain: birds sit under thick conifers to stay dry, hunter lore (Tip). Fresh snow: read tracks and roosts; birds dive into soft snow 20 centimetres or deeper, 75 percent. Bitter cold: feeding may shift to midday, hunter lore (Tip). Pressure front: no grouse study found, watch and log it in the Journal. Moon: no grouse study found, do not plan around it.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"506\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"188\" height=\"158\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f4eedf\" stroke=\"#d8cfb8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"36\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/><g transform=\"translate(36 36)\"><path d=\"M-16 -6 H8 c7 0 7 -9 1 -9\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"3.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M-16 2 H12 c7 0 7 -9 1 -9\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"3.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M-16 10 H4 c7 0 7 -9 1 -9\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"3.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></g>\n<text x=\"64\" y=\"42\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Strong wind</text>\n<text x=\"18\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Birds wild, flush far.</text>\n<text x=\"18\" y=\"97\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Hunt sheltered draws.</text>\n<rect x=\"18.0\" y=\"134\" width=\"122.4\" height=\"24\" rx=\"12.0\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"79.2\" y=\"151.04\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Tip: hunter lore</text>\n<rect x=\"204\" y=\"8\" width=\"188\" height=\"158\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f4eedf\" stroke=\"#d8cfb8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"232\" cy=\"36\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/><g transform=\"translate(232 36)\"><path d=\"M-14 0 a7 7 0 0 1 4 -12 a9 9 0 0 1 17 -2 a7 7 0 0 1 7 14z\" fill=\"#8a96a3\"/><path d=\"M-8 5 l-3 8\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M0 5 l-3 8\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M8 5 l-3 8\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></g>\n<text x=\"260\" y=\"42\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Rain</text>\n<text x=\"214\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Under thick conifers.</text>\n<text x=\"214\" y=\"97\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Birds stay dry there.</text>\n<rect x=\"214.0\" y=\"134\" width=\"122.4\" height=\"24\" rx=\"12.0\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"275.2\" y=\"151.04\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Tip: hunter lore</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"174\" width=\"188\" height=\"158\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f4eedf\" stroke=\"#d8cfb8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"202\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/><g transform=\"translate(36 202)\"><path d=\"M0 -15 V15\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" transform=\"rotate(0)\"/><path d=\"M0 -15 V15\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" transform=\"rotate(60)\"/><path d=\"M0 -15 V15\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" transform=\"rotate(120)\"/><circle r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/></g>\n<text x=\"64\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Fresh snow</text>\n<text x=\"18\" y=\"244\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Tracks and roosts.</text>\n<text x=\"18\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Birds dive into soft</text>\n<text x=\"18\" y=\"282\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">snow 20 cm+</text>\n<rect x=\"18.0\" y=\"300\" width=\"40.9\" height=\"24\" rx=\"12.0\" fill=\"#2f6e3b\"/><text x=\"38.4\" y=\"317.04\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">75%</text>\n<rect x=\"204\" y=\"174\" width=\"188\" height=\"158\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f4eedf\" stroke=\"#d8cfb8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"232\" cy=\"202\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/><g transform=\"translate(232 202)\"><rect x=\"-4\" y=\"-16\" width=\"8\" height=\"24\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cy=\"10\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"-1.5\" y=\"-2\" width=\"3\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/></g>\n<text x=\"260\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Bitter cold</text>\n<text x=\"214\" y=\"244\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Feeding may shift</text>\n<text x=\"214\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">to midday.</text>\n<rect x=\"214.0\" y=\"300\" width=\"122.4\" height=\"24\" rx=\"12.0\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"275.2\" y=\"317.04\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Tip: hunter lore</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"340\" width=\"188\" height=\"158\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f4eedf\" stroke=\"#d8cfb8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"368\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/><g transform=\"translate(36 368)\"><path d=\"M-15 6 A15 15 0 1 1 15 6\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M0 -15 V-11\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\" transform=\"rotate(-80)\"/><path d=\"M0 -15 V-11\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\" transform=\"rotate(-40)\"/><path d=\"M0 -15 V-11\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\" transform=\"rotate(0)\"/><path d=\"M0 -15 V-11\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\" transform=\"rotate(40)\"/><path d=\"M0 -15 V-11\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\" transform=\"rotate(80)\"/><path d=\"M0 2 L-9 -8\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cy=\"2\" r=\"3.4\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/></g>\n<text x=\"64\" y=\"374\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Pressure front</text>\n<text x=\"18\" y=\"410\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">No grouse study found.</text>\n<text x=\"18\" y=\"429\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Watch and log it</text>\n<text x=\"18\" y=\"448\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">(Journal).</text>\n<rect x=\"18.0\" y=\"466\" width=\"77.4\" height=\"24\" rx=\"12.0\" fill=\"#6b5b4b\"/><text x=\"56.7\" y=\"483.04\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">No study</text>\n<rect x=\"204\" y=\"340\" width=\"188\" height=\"158\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f4eedf\" stroke=\"#d8cfb8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"232\" cy=\"368\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/><g transform=\"translate(232 368)\"><path d=\"M4 -15 a15 15 0 1 0 11 24 a12 12 0 1 1 -11 -24z\" fill=\"#c9a227\"/></g>\n<text x=\"260\" y=\"374\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Moon</text>\n<text x=\"214\" y=\"410\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">No grouse study found.</text>\n<text x=\"214\" y=\"429\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Do not plan around it.</text>\n<rect x=\"214.0\" y=\"466\" width=\"77.4\" height=\"24\" rx=\"12.0\" fill=\"#6b5b4b\"/><text x=\"252.7\" y=\"483.04\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">No study</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Wind and rain move birds into shelter (hunter lore, 55 to 60%: Tip).</li><li>No grouse study found on pressure fronts or the moon.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: each weather type, with evidence</summary><div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Weather</th><th>What birds do</th><th>Evidence</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Strong wind</td><td>Wild, flush early; shelter in low, thick cover</td><td>Hunter lore (Tip)</td></tr><tr><td>Rain</td><td>Under middle aged conifers</td><td>Hunter lore (Tip)</td></tr><tr><td>Calm overcast</td><td>Moving and feeding; good hunting</td><td>Hunter lore (Tip)</td></tr><tr><td>Fresh soft snow</td><td>Snow roosts; tracks show everything</td><td>70 to 75%</td></tr><tr><td>Crust, deep cold</td><td>Into thick conifers; weight loss</td><td>85%</td></tr><tr><td>Falling pressure, cold front</td><td>No grouse study found</td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span></td></tr><tr><td>Moon phase</td><td>No grouse study found</td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li>Hunting magazine and blog advice says calm overcast days are best and windy days make grouse skittish (55 to 60%).</li><li>Keep your own record in the Journal: date, weather, flushes. Your data beats lore (Tip).</li><li>See also <a href=\"#/s/weather-moon\">Weather and the moon</a> for deer.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Top view of an open road with a shaded band 200 metres each side. In a Pennsylvania study, birds within about 200 metres of open roads were shot more often; more birds lived past 200 metres. Walk past the road band.\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Walk past the shot birds</text>\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"40\" width=\"400\" height=\"260\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\"/>\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"150\" width=\"400\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#c9b79c\"/>\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"100\" width=\"400\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#e8590c\" opacity=\".15\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"172\" width=\"400\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#e8590c\" opacity=\".15\"/>\n<text x=\"390\" y=\"166\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">Open road</text>\n<text x=\"10\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">0 to 200 m: shot most</text>\n<text x=\"10\" y=\"258\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Past 200 m: more birds live</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(60 125) scale(0.45 0.45)\"><polygon points=\"-20,-6 -38,-20 -48,-12 -52,0 -48,8 -20,8\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/><path d=\"M-40 -18 Q-50 -10 -48 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"26\" ry=\"15\" fill=\"#9a6b45\"/><circle cx=\"21\" cy=\"-14\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#9a6b45\"/><polygon points=\"16,-20 20,-28 25,-20\" fill=\"#9a6b45\"/><polygon points=\"28,-16 35,-13 28,-10\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/><circle cx=\"23\" cy=\"-16\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><path d=\"M2 13 l-2 11 M10 13 l2 11\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\"/></g>\n<g transform=\"translate(300 200) scale(0.45 0.45)\"><polygon points=\"-20,-6 -38,-20 -48,-12 -52,0 -48,8 -20,8\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/><path d=\"M-40 -18 Q-50 -10 -48 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"26\" ry=\"15\" fill=\"#9a6b45\"/><circle cx=\"21\" cy=\"-14\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#9a6b45\"/><polygon points=\"16,-20 20,-28 25,-20\" fill=\"#9a6b45\"/><polygon points=\"28,-16 35,-13 28,-10\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/><circle cx=\"23\" cy=\"-16\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><path d=\"M2 13 l-2 11 M10 13 l2 11\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\"/></g>\n<g transform=\"translate(120 60) scale(0.45 0.45)\"><polygon points=\"-20,-6 -38,-20 -48,-12 -52,0 -48,8 -20,8\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/><path d=\"M-40 -18 Q-50 -10 -48 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"26\" ry=\"15\" fill=\"#9a6b45\"/><circle cx=\"21\" cy=\"-14\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#9a6b45\"/><polygon points=\"16,-20 20,-28 25,-20\" fill=\"#9a6b45\"/><polygon points=\"28,-16 35,-13 28,-10\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/><circle cx=\"23\" cy=\"-16\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><path d=\"M2 13 l-2 11 M10 13 l2 11\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\"/></g>\n<g transform=\"translate(230 280) scale(0.45 0.45)\"><polygon points=\"-20,-6 -38,-20 -48,-12 -52,0 -48,8 -20,8\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/><path d=\"M-40 -18 Q-50 -10 -48 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"26\" ry=\"15\" fill=\"#9a6b45\"/><circle cx=\"21\" cy=\"-14\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#9a6b45\"/><polygon points=\"16,-20 20,-28 25,-20\" fill=\"#9a6b45\"/><polygon points=\"28,-16 35,-13 28,-10\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/><circle cx=\"23\" cy=\"-16\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><path d=\"M2 13 l-2 11 M10 13 l2 11\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\"/></g>\n<g transform=\"translate(350 60) scale(0.45 0.45)\"><polygon points=\"-20,-6 -38,-20 -48,-12 -52,0 -48,8 -20,8\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/><path d=\"M-40 -18 Q-50 -10 -48 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"26\" ry=\"15\" fill=\"#9a6b45\"/><circle cx=\"21\" cy=\"-14\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#9a6b45\"/><polygon points=\"16,-20 20,-28 25,-20\" fill=\"#9a6b45\"/><polygon points=\"28,-16 35,-13 28,-10\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/><circle cx=\"23\" cy=\"-16\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><path d=\"M2 13 l-2 11 M10 13 l2 11\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\"/></g>\n<g transform=\"translate(330 284) scale(0.45 0.45)\"><polygon points=\"-20,-6 -38,-20 -48,-12 -52,0 -48,8 -20,8\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/><path d=\"M-40 -18 Q-50 -10 -48 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"26\" ry=\"15\" fill=\"#9a6b45\"/><circle cx=\"21\" cy=\"-14\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#9a6b45\"/><polygon points=\"16,-20 20,-28 25,-20\" fill=\"#9a6b45\"/><polygon points=\"28,-16 35,-13 28,-10\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/><circle cx=\"23\" cy=\"-16\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><path d=\"M2 13 l-2 11 M10 13 l2 11\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\"/></g>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Birds close to open roads get shot more <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Walk past 200 m from the road (Tip, based on the study).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: detail</summary><ul><li>Pennsylvania: 48% harvest rate near open roads versus 19% farther away; male survival 23% within 201 m of roads versus 36% beyond <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Opening weekend and the first snow bring the most hunters (Tip).</li><li>Weekday mornings on gated roads see the least traffic (Tip).</li><li>The flip side: birds far from roads are less shot, not less wary (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 430\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A 24 hour clock of a grouse day, hunter lore, 75 percent. About 6 to 9 am: feed and pick grit on edges and roads. About 9 am to 3 pm: rest and dust bathe. About 3 pm to dusk: feed again. Night: roost in trees or snow. Legal hunting hours: 1 hour before sunrise to 1 hour after sunset. Tip: at midday spruce and dusky grouse often sit in trees, which is your .22 time.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"430\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A grouse day (hunter lore, 75%)</text>\n<circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"168\" r=\"110\" fill=\"#f4eedf\"/>\n<path d=\"M96.0 168.0 A104 104 0 0 1 304.0 168.0 L248.0 168.0 A48 48 0 0 0 152.0 168.0z\" fill=\"#3d4f6b\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n<path d=\"M304.0 168.0 A104 104 0 0 1 273.5 241.5 L233.9 201.9 A48 48 0 0 0 248.0 168.0z\" fill=\"#e9c46a\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n<path d=\"M273.5 241.5 A104 104 0 0 1 126.5 241.5 L166.1 201.9 A48 48 0 0 0 233.9 201.9z\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n<path d=\"M126.5 241.5 A104 104 0 0 1 96.0 168.0 L152.0 168.0 A48 48 0 0 0 166.1 201.9z\" fill=\"#e9c46a\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"97\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Roost</text>\n<text x=\"270.2\" y=\"202.1\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Feed</text>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"249\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Rest, dust</text>\n<text x=\"129.8\" y=\"202.1\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Feed</text>\n<circle cx=\"153.7\" cy=\"107.7\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#f3e7b3\"/><circle cx=\"157.3\" cy=\"105.7\" r=\"6.8\" fill=\"#3d4f6b\"/>\n<circle cx=\"246.3\" cy=\"107.7\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#e9e4cf\"/><circle cx=\"232.3\" cy=\"115.7\" r=\"1.3\" fill=\"#e9e4cf\"/>\n<circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"168\" r=\"46\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"174\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">24 hours</text>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Midnight</text>\n<text x=\"320\" y=\"173\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">6 am</text>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Noon</text>\n<text x=\"80\" y=\"173\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"end\">6 pm</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"316\" width=\"384\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f4eedf\"/>\n<circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"336\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#8f8d86\"/><circle cx=\"27\" cy=\"330\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#8f8d86\"/><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"337\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#8f8d86\"/><circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"339\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#8f8d86\"/>\n<text x=\"46\" y=\"338\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Morning feed includes grit on road edges.</text>\n<circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"369\" r=\"10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><path d=\"M26 363 V369 L30 372\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"/>\n<text x=\"46\" y=\"374\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Legal: 1 h before sunrise to 1 h after sunset.</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"388\" width=\"384\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f4eedf\"/>\n<rect x=\"24.5\" y=\"413.0\" width=\"3\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#5a3d22\"/><path d=\"M26.0 393.0 L31.5 403.8 L29.0 403.8 L36.1 414.0 L15.9 414.0 L23.0 403.8 L20.5 403.8z\" fill=\"#3a5a31\"/>\n<text x=\"46\" y=\"410\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Midday: spruce, dusky often sit in trees (Tip).</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Rhyme: \"Gravel at dawn, dust at noon, berries at dusk, roost by the moon.\"</li><li>Number trick: \"1 and 1\": 1 hour before sunrise to 1 hour after sunset.</li><li>Old hand's rule (tradition): \"Wind day, low and thick. Rain day, under the firs.\"</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: more hooks</summary><ul><li>\"Look up at noon.\"</li><li>\"200 m past the road.\"</li><li>\"No study on the moon\": do not plan around it.</li><li>Rhymes are made for this course; the wind and rain rules are common hunter advice, not science.</li></ul></details>","<ul><li>Rule Book, Pennsylvania Game Commission, Hinterland Who's Who, BC species account, hunting writers. Checked 2026-10-11.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: every source</summary><ul><li>Rule Book: <a href=\"#/s/rb-legal-methods/13\">hunting hours</a>, synopsis 2 October 2026 edition, page 11, items 37 and 38 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li><a href=\"https://www.pa.gov/agencies/pgc/wildlife/discover-pa-wildlife/ruffed-grouse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pennsylvania Game Commission, Ruffed grouse</a>, read directly <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li><a href=\"https://www.hww.ca/en/wildlife/birds/ruffed-grouse.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hinterland Who's Who, Ruffed grouse</a>, read directly <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li><li><a href=\"https://www.env.gov.bc.ca/wld/frpa/iwms/documents/Birds/b_columbiansharptailedgrouse.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BC species account, Columbian Sharp tailed Grouse</a>, read directly <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li><li><a href=\"https://projectupland.com/grouse-species/ruffed-grouse/hunting-ruffed-grouse-in-the-rain/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Project Upland, Hunting ruffed grouse in the rain</a>, search preview <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">60%</span>.</li><li>Weather and upland hunting blogs and Ruffed Grouse Society winter strategies, search preview (50 to 55%, Tip only).</li><li>Washington Department of Fish and Wildlife, spruce grouse, read 2026-10-01 <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">80%</span>.</li><li>All checked 2026-10-11 unless noted. <a href=\"#/sources\">Hunt Mentor research notes (summary of the sources listed in Sources)</a>.</li></ul></details>"]